        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion RH-B2, Radius Rose Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Round Mount Robe Hook is a great example of how something that is utilitarian in design can also be stylish. This hook has a rustic look that really adds warmth and depth to the piece. The radius rose has a 2-5/8 inch diameter. This Robe hook is easy to install and comes with all the hardware to do so. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-round-mount-towel-bar-fusion-tb-b2\"><b>Fusion TB-B2 Traditional Round Mount Towel Bar</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-round-mount-wall-mounted-towel-ring-fusion-tr-b2\"><b>Fusion TR-B2 Traditional Round Mount Towel Ring</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-round-mount-toilet-paper-roll-holder-fusion-ph-b2\"><b>Fusion PH-B2 Traditional Round Mount Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Fusion Radius Trim Robe Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
